# Local: http://localhost:5001 | Docker: http://localhost:6001
@Identity.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001

### 1. Đăng ký tài khoản Rider (Chỉ bắn UserCreated)
POST {{Identity.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "rider01",
  "email": "rider01@swiftride.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van Rider",
  "role": "Rider"
}

### 2. Đăng ký tài khoản Driver (Bắn UserCreated và DriverCreated)
POST {{Identity.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "driver01",
  "email": "driver01@swiftride.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "fullName": "Tran Van Driver",
  "role": "Driver"
}

### 3. Đăng nhập bằng UserName hoặc Email (Login)
POST {{Identity.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userNameOrEmail": "driver01@swiftride.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### 4. Lấy danh sách Riders (vai trò Rider)
GET {{Identity.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/riders
Accept: application/json

### 5. Lấy danh sách Drivers (vai trò Driver)
GET {{Identity.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/drivers
Accept: application/json

### 6. Lấy tất cả Users (hoặc lọc theo query: ?role=Driver / ?role=Rider)
GET {{Identity.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users
Accept: application/json

### 7. Xem Scalar API Documentation
# Mở trình duyệt tại: http://localhost:5001/scalar/v1 (hoặc Docker: http://localhost:6001/scalar/v1)
